---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Mentoring"
  description="One-to-one mentoring for early- and mid-career people in space, sustainability, science communication and mission-led digital work."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/work-with-me/">Work with me</a> / Mentoring</nav>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Mentoring</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        A structured, confidential space to think through your next step in science, space, sustainability or
        communications, with someone who has moved between those worlds.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="block two-col">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">Who it’s for</h2>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Early- and mid-career professionals in space, sustainability, science communication or mission-led digital work</li>
          <li>Scientists considering a move into communications, policy, engagement or commercial roles</li>
          <li>People who want structured time to reflect on direction and confidence at work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">What we can cover</h2>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Moving from research into communications or strategy</li>
          <li>Building a portfolio, CV or online presence</li>
          <li>Understanding the space and sustainability sectors</li>
          <li>Chartership and professional membership routes</li>
          <li>Planning and prioritising your own development</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What mentoring is not</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Not therapy or counselling, and not a substitute for either.</li>
        <li>Not recruitment or a job-placement service, and I can’t promise any employment outcome.</li>
        <li>Not formal coaching accreditation or legal, financial or medical advice.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Format and expectations</h2>
      <dl class="facts">
        <dt>Format</dt><dd>One-to-one video calls, or in person in Leicester by arrangement.</dd>
        <dt>Rhythm</dt><dd>Agreed together at the start. A first conversation is used to check we’re a good fit.</dd>
        <dt>Confidentiality</dt><dd>What you share stays between us, apart from any safeguarding concern.</dd>
        <dt>Your part</dt><dd>Come with a question or topic, and be willing to try things between sessions.</dd>
        <dt>Availability and fees</dt><dd>Availability changes through the year. Ask and I’ll tell you where things stand.</dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="bp" href="/contact/#mentoring">Ask about mentoring</a>
        <a class="bo" href="/mentoring/specialist/">Specialist mentoring for neurodivergent students and early-career professionals</a>
        <a class="bo" href="/coaching/">ADHD-informed coaching for adults</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
